<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21117] sanity-pfl test_setup: client mount times out after sanity-lnet</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21117</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Client mounts fail with Connection timed out while restoring Lustre at the end of sanity-lnet, then fail again in sanity-pfl setup. Setup reports NAME=autotest_config not mounted. No PFL subtest starts. Autotest records Autotest time out although auster finishes with rc 0 in about eight minutes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Current master review: change 68474 PS16, review-dne-zfs-part-2, el9.8 clients/servers, ZFS. Session &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/eee4781e-ad19-40a4-92bf-5f6080acd279" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/eee4781e-ad19-40a4-92bf-5f6080acd279&lt;/a&gt; ; failed set &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/74b9781d-32f9-4480-a455-7285c5251318" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/74b9781d-32f9-4480-a455-7285c5251318&lt;/a&gt; . The preceding sanity-lnet suite also shows the client mount timeouts during final restoration.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pre-existing matching failure on unrelated change 66253 PS28, 2026-10-08, review-dne-part-2 (ldiskfs): &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/746fc462-07c8-4ae0-9dd9-2477c7b78e7b" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/746fc462-07c8-4ae0-9dd9-2477c7b78e7b&lt;/a&gt; . Its suite log has the same client mount timeouts followed by NAME=autotest_config not mounted. Both runs last completed sanity-lnet test_629 before PFL setup; both auster runs ended rc 0 while Autotest recorded setup timeout. The earlier session passed its retest. This establishes the failure predates this MGS change; the underlying mount timeout cause remains undetermined.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rainshadow 30-day history: 3 setup failures among 4219 review suite runs (0.07 percent), including this one. This aggregate includes a different mountmds failure on 69257, not counted as a matching cause. Searches for sanity-pfl test_setup, NAME=autotest_config not mounted, and mount/setup ticket candidates found no covering ticket. &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18494" title="sanity-lnet test_253: Error: 'Failed cleanup' also memory leaks detected" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18494"&gt;LU-18494&lt;/a&gt; is a different sanity-lnet/253 cleanup memory leak. No local reproduction or patch modification.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-68474-ps16-0ecd11b72aa8 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/68474" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/68474&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
